/* =================================================================
   EXTENDED TEST LIBRARY — shared by the Gut Health, Diabetes and GLP-1 apps
   Adds hormone panels, full cholesterol, full blood count and chemistry,
   urinalysis, stool chemistry, GI-MAP (pathogens, overgrowth, parasites,
   worms, fungi, commensals, markers), microbiome reports and breath tests.

   Each entry uses the same fields as the app's own LAB_MARKERS:
     u / alt (unit conversions to the canonical unit), pl (plausible range),
     ref / opt (reference and optimal ranges, or {m:[..], f:[..]}),
     dir, crit, a (name pattern), not (exclude pattern)
   Qualitative results: q:true, with optional qpos / qneg patterns and
     qlab (labels for the two states, e.g. ['Low','Normal']).
   w = condition points per app (gut | sugar | glp1), merged in by the app:
     hi / lo (out of range), ok (on target), pos / neg (qualitative).
   pri:true = checked before the app's own markers (more specific names).
   Educational use only; ranges vary between labs.
================================================================= */
